# GitHub Storage Configuration
# 1. Create a PRIVATE GitHub repository (e.g., "myuser/music-vault")
# 2. Create a Personal Access Token (PAT) with "repo" scope at:
#    https://github.com/settings/tokens
# 3. Copy this file to "config.env" and fill in your details.

# Your GitHub Personal Access Token
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_secret_token_here

# The repository name (Format: username/repo)
GITHUB_REPO=jasparryding/teenmusic-storage
e
# The branch to commit to (default is main)
GITHUB_BRANCH=main
